### Issue Structure

[Permalink: Issue Structure](https://github.com/open-circle/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/valibot/SKILL.md#issue-structure)

Each issue contains:

- `kind`: 'schema' \| 'validation' \| 'transformation'
- `type`: Function name (e.g., 'string', 'email', 'min\_length')
- `input`: The problematic input
- `expected`: What was expected
- `received`: What was received
- `message`: Human-readable message
- `path`: Array of path items for nested issues

